WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.566 --> 00:00:13.033
Machine load: every machine's queue for two weeks. The bag makers are full, the laminators have room.

2
00:00:13.688 --> 00:00:19.634
A job behind its plan pushes every job after it, the same morning.

3
00:00:21.103 --> 00:00:27.634
Two short lid film runs of the same structure wait for the same peel film.

4
00:00:28.262 --> 00:00:34.362
The program lays both on one web: lanes of both widths side by side.

5
00:00:34.977 --> 00:00:41.835
Apart and together, side by side: square metres, setup time, setup waste, trim.

6
00:00:42.463 --> 00:00:50.476
Together they save 28 kg of film and 80 minutes of setup. On short runs the setup weighs most.

7
00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:59.248
The planner accepts. The plan books one laminate for both orders.

8
00:01:00.695 --> 00:01:05.916
On the machine load: one shared laminate instead of two.
